lerts.mdx","Alertas y suscripciones","Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/alerts",{"_60":214},"platform/pki/alerts.mdx",{"_34":216,"_41":64,"_56":-7,"_36":217},"es:_3","Administrar Lamassu",{"_34":219,"_41":53,"_36":24,"_47":220,"_56":-7,"_13":22,"_58":221},"es:platform/pki/access-control.mdx","Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP.",{"_60":222},"platform/pki/access-control.mdx",{"_34":224,"_41":53,"_36":225,"_47":226,"_56":-7,"_13":227,"_58":228},"es:platform/pki/audit-logs.mdx","Registros de auditoría","Entiende qué eventos de auditoría genera Lamassu y cómo convertirlos en una pista durable.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs",{"_60":229},"platform/pki/audit-logs.mdx",{"_34":231,"_41":53,"_36":232,"_47":233,"_56":-7,"_13":234,"_58":235},"es:platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas","Diagnostica acceso, salud, emisión, enrolamiento y dependencias en un despliegue de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting",{"_60":236},"platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_34":238,"_41":64,"_56":-7,"_36":239},"es:_4","Integraciones",{"_34":241,"_41":53,"_36":242,"_47":243,"_56":-7,"_13":244,"_58":245},"es:platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core",{"_60":246},"platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","es:platform",{"_249":250},"metaFile","platform/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/images/lamassu.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/images/lamassu.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.